        "original_id": "d2ea0fa8-45a0-576f-84f8-ee9afc167c3e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, Sonali Bendre, Anu Malik, Aadesh Shrivastava\n- Products: Angaaray (1998 film), Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Barood, Zulmi\n- Topics: film cast, music composition, box office performance, death\n\nFacts:\n- Angaaray is a 1998 film starring Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, and Sonali Bendre in lead roles.\n- The music for Angaaray was composed by Anu Malik and Aadesh Shrivastava.\n- In the 1990s, Akshay Kumar's releases Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Angaaray, Barood, and Zulmi performed poorly at the box office and caused a setback in his film career.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer in Kokilaben Hospital a day after turning 51.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "6b0cccb5-e2c1-5ecf-b44d-94afa5328a1e",
